{"id":"7af3f1703af3792c","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-reliabilityorthogonal.md","title":"Reliability from an orthogonal DNF","display":"thm-reliabilityorthogonal — Reliability from an orthogonal DNF","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-reliabilityorthogonal","aliases":["27-thm-reliabilityorthogonal"],"display":"thm-reliabilityorthogonal — Reliability from an orthogonal DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.13.4","source_printed_pages":"58,59","source_pdf_pages":"82,83","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-reliabilityorthogonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-reliabilityorthogonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reliabilityorthogonal — Reliability from an orthogonal DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"196449e4ff7c48d2\" href=\"?note=196449e4ff7c48d2\" title=\"27-df-bernoulliproduct\">27-df-bernoulliproduct</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.13.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"58,59"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"82,83"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[m]\">\\(k\\in[m]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]\">\\(A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing\">\\(A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_k,f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(C_k,f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 由下式构造，假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall k,l\\in[m]\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(k\\ne l\\Rightarrow C_k(a)C_l(a)=0)\">\\(\\forall k,l\\in[m]\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(k\\ne l\\Rightarrow C_k(a)C_l(a)=0)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in U_n=[0,1]^n\">\\(p\\in U_n=[0,1]^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_p\">\\(\\beta_p\\)</span> 与有限期望 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_p\">\\(\\mathbb E_p\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"196449e4ff7c48d2\" href=\"?note=196449e4ff7c48d2\" title=\"27-df-bernoulliproduct\">27-df-bernoulliproduct</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_f:U_n\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_f:U_n\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 由下式定义，空积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_k(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\quad(k\\in[m],\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_k(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\quad(k\\in[m],\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{C_k(a)\\mid k\\in[m]\\}\\bigr)\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{C_k(a)\\mid k\\in[m]\\}\\bigr)\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_f(p)\\coloneqq\\mathbb E_p[f]=\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)f(a)\\quad(p\\in U_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rel}_f(p)\\coloneqq\\mathbb E_p[f]=\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)f(a)\\quad(p\\in U_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_f(p)=\\sum_{k=1}^m\\prod_{i\\in A_k}p_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-p_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rel}_f(p)=\\sum_{k=1}^m\\prod_{i\\in A_k}p_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-p_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_f(\\tfrac12,\\ldots,\\tfrac12)=2^{-n}|\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rel}_f(\\tfrac12,\\ldots,\\tfrac12)=2^{-n}|\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正交性使 f 的布尔析取逐点等于各项的实数和；对内部定义的 Bernoulli 乘积质量逐坐标求和，将每项有限期望分解为边际概率的乘积。这是书中可靠性计算的实际机制；普通重叠 DNF 不能直接把各项概率相加。此式本身对非单调 f 也成立，但只有满足应用解释的单调结构函数才表示标准系统可靠性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bernoulliproduct","status":"resolved","id":"196449e4ff7c48d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bernoulliproduct","status":"resolved","id":"196449e4ff7c48d2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；对每个 $k\\in[m]$，$A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]$ 且 $A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing$。$C_k,f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式构造，假定 $\\forall k,l\\in[m]\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(k\\ne l\\Rightarrow C_k(a)C_l(a)=0)$。$p\\in U_n=[0,1]^n$，$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\beta_p$ 与有限期望 $\\mathbb E_p$ 见 [[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]。$\\mathrm{Rel}_f:U_n\\to[0,1]$ 由下式定义，空积为 $1$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[m]","display":false},{"tex":"A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"C_k,f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k,l\\in[m]\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(k\\ne l\\Rightarrow C_k(a)C_l(a)=0)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in U_n=[0,1]^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_f:U_n\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"C_k(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\quad(k\\in[m],\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{C_k(a)\\mid k\\in[m]\\}\\bigr)\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_f(p)\\coloneqq\\mathbb E_p[f]=\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)f(a)\\quad(p\\in U_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_f(p)=\\sum_{k=1}^m\\prod_{i\\in A_k}p_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-p_j).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_f(\\tfrac12,\\ldots,\\tfrac12)=2^{-n}|\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}|.","display":true}],"bytes":2170,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-reliabilityorthogonal|thm-reliabilityorthogonal — Reliability from an orthogonal DNF]]"}],"outgoing":["196449e4ff7c48d2"]}